{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23995","headline":"与诸道者同游二室至九龙潭作 · 白居易","name":"与诸道者同游二室至九龙潭作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"喜逢二室游仙子，厌作三川守土臣。\n举手摩挲潭上石，开襟斗薮府中尘。\n他日终爲独往客，今朝未是自由身。\n若言尹是嵩山主，三十六峰应笑人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23995.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23995","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}